      "id": "claim_a73f8fbc44a0477182cfc7593c9e0cda",
      "statement": "The public `search(query, max_results=10, timeout=30, max_retries=3)` workflow validates non-empty string queries, limits `max_results` to integers 1 through 10, and returns a non-empty list of normalized `title`, `href`, and `body` dictionaries or raises typed search errors.",
