      "id": "claim_43207a82cde94030a173fe5870070447",
      "statement": "Only `primp.ConnectError` and `primp.TimeoutError` are retryable: search makes the initial request plus up to `max_retries` additional attempts, uses exponential backoff from one second capped at ten seconds, and wraps an exhausted transient failure as a chained `SearchRequestError`; status failures are translated immediately.",
